      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Running is the autonomous scheduling slice for one run inside a project session. RunState binds stable identity and immutable inputs to control status, while the director turns active dispatch authority into epochs and claims. The pages separate durable run control, deterministic scheduling, candidate prioritization, and process liveness so each concept has one owner."
        }
      ],
